@startuml Tambah_Ke_Keranjang
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Tambah Ke Keranjang (Add to Cart)
actor Customer
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Pilih Produk & Input Jumlah
App -> App: Validasi Input (Stok Tersedia)

alt Input Valid
    App -> API: POST /api/cart/add
    note right of App
        Request Body:
        - product_id
        - quantity
        - customer_id
    end note
    API -> DB: Check Stok Produk
    DB --> API: Stok Available
    API -> DB: Insert/Update Cart Item
    DB --> API: Success
    API --> App: Response 200 (Item ditambah)
    App -> App: Update Cart Counter
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Toast "Produk ditambahkan\nke keranjang"
else Input Invalid (Stok Kurang)
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Error "Stok tidak cukup"
end

@enduml